'''Sector 3''' was a location in the [[western outskirts]] on the [[planet]] [[Ryloth]]. Shortly after the [[Proclamation of the New Order|formation]] of the [[Galactic Empire]], an Imperial [[convoy]] carrying [[Twi'lek]] [[prisoner]]s including [[General]] [[Cham Syndulla]]'s daughter [[Hera Syndulla|Hera]] passed through Sector 3 on its way to [[Lessu City|Lessu]], the [[capital]] [[city]]. The convoy was [[Rescue of Hera Syndulla (Ryloth)|attacked]] before it reached its destination, as Cham and his wife [[Eleni Syndulla|Eleni]] hoped to rescue the captives.<ref name="Devil's Deal" />

